" - `++[++::++]++`\n"
" - `localhost`\n"
" - `localhost:8084`\n"
"\n"
"Examples of a CIDR notation:\n"
"\n"
" - `::/128`\n"
" - `::/0`\n"
" - `127.0.0.0/8`\n"
"\n"
"Please bear in mind that IPv4 CIDR won't match request sent from the IPv6 address and the other way around.\n"
"\n"
